# Stonetalon Mountains - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics and formulas whose SOURCE is
# physically in Stonetalon Mountains, verified against the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Four recipes are
# vendor-sold in-zone (one sole-vendor); three more drop each from a single
# in-zone mob and nowhere else in the data. In-zone recipes sold only by
# Horde-faction vendors are excluded (Alterac precedent — see
# docs/stonetalon-companions-inventory.md), every other Stonetalon-dropping
# recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest records carry no reward
# data (see docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Tailoring, Enchanting, First
# Aid and Fishing have no Stonetalon source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/stonetalon-recipes
title Stonetalon Mountains - Recipes & Patterns
levels 16-30
zone Stonetalon Mountains
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords stonetalon, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Leatherworking — the north (Harlown Darkweave)

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 6731 -- Harlown Darkweave (53.2, 16.9), Leatherworking Supplies
  buy 7361 "Pattern: Herbalist's Gloves"
  note Harlown is the only vendor anywhere in the data selling this pattern (he also works the Ashenvale side; this is his Stonetalon point). Stock class is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Engineering — the east (Veenix)

  when skill Engineering 1

  vendor 4086 -- Veenix (58.22, 51.74), Venture Co. Merchant
  buy 7561 "Schematic: Goblin Jumper Cables"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Cooking — the south (Janet Hommers)

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 8150 -- Janet Hommers (40.7, 81.7), Food & Drink
  buy 12233 "Recipe: Mystery Stew"
  buy 12240 "Recipe: Heavy Kodo Stew"
  note Janet also works the Thousand Needles side; this is her Stonetalon point. Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Cooking — the east (rare drop)

  when skill Cooking 1

  loop
  goto 73.13,61.06
  goto 73.53,58.74
  goto 73.8,59.26
  goto 73.92,59.62
  goto 74.43,58.39
  goto 75.67,59.2
  collect 249880 "Recipe: Royal Tea" optional
  note Dropped only by the Windshear Geomancer (level 20); the recipe drops nowhere else in the data.

