  when skill Alchemy 1

  loop
  goto 30.18,64.33
  goto 30.93,59.23
  goto 31.34,60.42
  goto 31.83,58.76
  goto 31.95,66.51
  goto 32.57,60.66
  goto 32.75,64.45
  goto 33.36,64.99
  goto 34.51,60.8
  goto 35.25,63.21
  goto 37.36,49.09
  goto 37.79,44.11
  collect 250382 "Recipe: Elixir of Spirit" optional
  note Dropped only by the Bloodfury Harpy (level 23); the recipe drops nowhere else in the data.

step Blacksmithing — the south (rare drop)

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  loop
  goto 58.15,90.75
  goto 58.28,89.89
  goto 58.51,91.47
  goto 58.74,89.58
  goto 59.03,89.94
  goto 59.57,90.25
  goto 59.61,92.77
  goto 60,90.26
  goto 60.08,92.07
  goto 60.44,90.99
  goto 60.57,91.43
  goto 61.08,92.46
  goto 61.28,90.98
  goto 61.93,93.42
  goto 62.14,93.05
  goto 62.22,93.59
  goto 62.44,92.25
  goto 62.67,92.57
  collect 251454 "Plans: Brass Knuckles" optional
  note Dropped only by the Gogger Rock Keeper (level 16); the plans drop nowhere else in the data.

step Tailoring, Enchanting, First Aid, Fishing — no Stonetalon source

  note The data holds no Tailoring, Enchanting, First Aid or Fishing recipe sourced in Stonetalon Mountains: no in-zone vendor sells one and no in-zone mob drops one. (The in-zone Horde vendors Jeeda and Kulwia sell a potion and two enchantments, but they are Horde-faction — see the inventory doc.) Polestar's own profession guides cover those professions' progression.
